---
const mapsQuery = 'Pollo Fresa México';
const embedUrl = `https://www.google.com/maps?q=${encodeURIComponent(mapsQuery)}&output=embed`;
const mapsUrl = `https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=${encodeURIComponent(mapsQuery)}`;
---

<section class="locations" aria-labelledby="ubicaciones-title">
  <div class="locations-inner">
    <header class="heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Encuentra Pollo Fresa</p><h2 id="ubicaciones-title">Siempre hay una<br /><i>cerca de ti.</i></h2></div>
      <p>Consulta nuestras sucursales en el mapa y elige la que te quede más cerca para disfrutar tu pollo recién hecho.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="map-layout">
      <aside class="location-panel">
        <span class="panel-number">01 / UBICACIONES</span>
        <div><span class="pin-icon">●</span><h3>Elige tu sucursal</h3><p>Abre el mapa para consultar direcciones, rutas y sucursales disponibles.</p></div>
        <dl><div><dt>Horarios</dt><dd>Consulta el horario de cada sucursal</dd></div><div><dt>Servicio</dt><dd>Pedidos para llevar</dd></div></dl>
        <a href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Ver todas en Google Maps</a>
      </aside>

      <div class="google-map">
        <iframe src={embedUrl} title="Sucursales de Pollo Fresa en Google Maps" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe>
        <div class="map-badge" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span><strong>POLLO<br />FRESA</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="location-footer"><p><span>◎</span> Usa el mapa para encontrar la ruta más rápida</p><a href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Cómo llegar</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .locations { padding: 112px 32px; color: #422018; background: #f7e7cc; }.locations-inner { width: min(1160px, 100%); margin: auto; }.heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 330px; gap: 50px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 45px; }.eyebrow { margin: 0 0 14px; color: #c51f2b; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .17em; text-transform: uppercase; }.eyebrow span { display: inline-block; width: 29px; height: 2px; margin: 0 11px 3px 0; background: #c51f2b; }h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(45px, 5vw, 68px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: .89; }h2 i { color: #c51f2b; font-style: normal; }.heading > p { margin: 0 0 3px; color: #79584a; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; }.map-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 340px 1fr; min-height: 520px; box-shadow: 0 24px 55px #42201818; }.location-panel { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; padding: 31px 30px; color: #fff4df; background: #422018; }.panel-number { color: #ffd36a; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .17em; }.pin-icon { display: grid; width: 47px; height: 47px; place-items: center; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #ffd36a; background: #c51f2b; border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 8px; transform: rotate(-12deg); }.location-panel h3 { margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 34px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 1; }.location-panel > div p { margin: 0; color: #fff4dfaa; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.65; }.location-panel dl { display: grid; gap: 14px; margin: 27px 0; }.location-panel dl div { padding-top: 13px; border-top: 1px solid #ffd36a2e; }.location-panel dt { margin-bottom: 4px; color: #ffd36a; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }.location-panel dd { margin: 0; color: #fff4dfc4; font-size: 11px; }.location-panel > a { padding: 16px 17px; color: #fff; background: #c51f2b; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; }.location-panel > a span { margin-left: 12px; color: #ffd36a; font-size: 17px; }.google-map { position: relative; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; background: #ffd36a; }.google-map iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; min-height: 520px; border: 0; filter: saturate(.88) contrast(1.04); }.map-badge { position: absolute; z-index: 2; right: 21px; bottom: 21px; display: grid; width: 76px; height: 76px; place-items: center; border: 2px solid #fff4df; border-radius: 50%; color: #fff4df; background: #c51f2be8; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px #42201833; }.map-badge span { position: absolute; top: 5px; color: #ffd36a; font-size: 9px; }.map-badge strong { font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .1em; line-height: 1.05; }.location-footer { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 18px 22px; background: #ffd36a; }.location-footer p { margin: 0; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }.location-footer p span { margin-right: 8px; color: #c51f2b; }.location-footer a { color: #422018; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none; }.location-footer a span { margin-left: 12px; color: #c51f2b; font-size: 16px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .heading { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }.heading > p { max-width: 460px; }.map-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.location-panel { min-height: 390px; }.google-map iframe { min-height: 430px; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .locations { padding: 80px 18px; }.heading { margin-bottom: 30px; }.location-panel { min-height: 410px; padding: 25px 22px; }.google-map iframe { min-height: 380px; }.location-footer p { max-width: 210px; line-height: 1.5; }.location-footer a { font-size: 0; }.location-footer a span { font-size: 19px; } }
</style>
